UnitAerodromeMigration::DecreaseTailEmissionRate
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── when the V2 tail emission rate increases
    │   ├── it should revert with TailEmissionRateNotDecreased
    │   └── it should succeed after setting the result to Defeated
    ├── when the V2 tail emission rate remains unchanged
    │   ├── it should revert with TailEmissionRateNotDecreased
    │   └── it should succeed after setting the result to Defeated
    └── when the V2 tail emission rate decreases
        ├── when the contract is unpaused
        │   ├── it should nudge the V2 Minter
        │   └── it should emit the NudgeExecuted event
        └── when the contract is paused
            ├── it should nudge the V2 Minter
            └── it should emit the NudgeExecuted event
